	)
	(text "To PSU:\n 30V Zener Limit,\n 40V TVS protection\n 1R,1W series resistor.\n\nIrmax = 30V/1R = 30A (short to gnd) ouch!\nPSU current expected is ~200..400mA.\nDesign Imax out of PSU ~= 2A/12V = 24W (regulator spec).\n\nSo for 1R, with 16V and 30V feed voltage:\nat 30V, 24W = (24/30) = 0.8A => Vr is 1R*0.8A = 0.8V, so Heat = 0.8*0.8 = 0.64W.\nat 16V, 24W = (24/16) = 1.5A => Vr is 1R*1.5A = 1.5V, so Heat = 1.5*1.5 = 2.25W.\n\nfor 0.5R, with 16V and 30V feed voltage:\nat 30V, 24W = (24/30) = 0.8A => Vr is 0.5R*0.8A = 0.4V, so Heat = 0.4*0.4 = 0.16W.\nat 16V, 24W = (24/16) = 1.5A => Vr is 0.5R*1.5A = 0.75V, so Heat = 1.5*1.5 = 0.56W.\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 72.644 26.162 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.889 0.889)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "6182d23a-bd38-4ef7-b65c-9242468dd249")
	)
	(text "Current->Voltage sensor & potential divider, linked\nto ADC/MCU to measure input I & V.\n\nCap CP1 stores current while PWM has switched Q4 off,\nsmoothing the load on the panels. CP2 helps manage\nhigher frequency changes."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 133.604 148.082 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.889 0.889)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "6de0e237-9adc-43eb-a220-62f43de6b229")
	)
